# The three blobs and the licence text are deliberately absent from this repo.
#
# brcmfmac43456-sdio.{bin,txt,clm_blob} are proprietary and covered by the
# Synaptics DRIVER END USER LICENSE AGREEMENT (BINARY DISTRIBUTION); shipping
# them into a git history is effectively permanent and hard to undo. The OpenWrt
# tree ignores the same path for the same reason.
#
# They only need to exist on disk for the build to work. Fetch them from
# RPi-Distro/firmware-nonfree, branch trixie, commit
# 3bab0f823f5b53150b76aab77093adef6655b920:
#
#   debian/added-firmware/brcm/brcmfmac43456-sdio.bin
#   debian/added-firmware/brcm/brcmfmac43456-sdio.txt
#   debian/added-firmware/brcm/brcmfmac43456-sdio.clm_blob
#
# ...into this directory as brcmfmac43456-sdio.bin, .txt and .clm_blob. The
# licence text goes alongside as LICENSE.Synaptics, extracted from debian/copyright
# in the same commit by scripts/extract-synaptics-license.py.
#
# Build/Verify in ../Makefile asserts all four sha256 sums and refuses to build
# on a mismatch, so a wrong or truncated download cannot slip through silently.
*
!.gitignore
